    "semetey-1-2013:p0482:b004:l025": "Будурала тоо менен exact Будурала uncertain descriptor or name; whole verse held without silently бүдүр ала correction. Completion-first first pass: Low-confidence approximate rendering for “Будурала тоо менен”; nearest corpus parallel was “Айсарала ат менен”.",
