    "semetey-1-2013:p0484:b003:l001": "Restored after root and worker reviewed printed PDF484 and the preceding Akkelte gun description. Primary Yudakhin болжош I means distinguishing sign/mark (sources/raw/yudakhin-2015.pdf, printed156); Үнү бийик describes its loud voice/report, болжошу its mark. The nominal construction is rendered as a distinguishing feature; no aiming property or use as a military signal added. Printed Kyrgyz unchanged; provisional interpretation, not specialist certification.",
